The main program reads from a local XML file, dynamically allocating memory for each task node, and processes each task by calculating the weighted average of its priority and deadline fields, appending this value as a new attribute in the output. The program handles varying node structures and ensures computations are accurate, even when dealing with incomplete or malformed data.

