// Allocate memory for an array of offset_t type and initialize it with increasing values starting from 0. The maximum size of this array is limited by a predefined constant MAX_OFFSETS to prevent excessive memory usage. Consider the implications of page faults and fragmentation on system performance when setting this limit.
