To ensure efficient handling of large volumes of packets while maintaining stability under high load conditions, this implementation uses a modular design that allows for easy integration with other components of the network stack. It also addresses potential issues such as memory fragmentation and ensures that the system can recover gracefully from unexpected resource constraints.

