The function also implements a caching mechanism to store item metadata and minimize redundant file reads, focusing on data freshness and reducing load on storage devices. It handles various file structures and ensures accuracy in computations, even with incomplete or malformed data. The function includes robust error handling for file read failures, incorporating retry mechanisms with exponential backoff and circuit breakers to prevent overwhelming the storage system during transient failures.

