The function also supports multiple concurrent clients, each managing its own cache and error handling mechanisms, while maintaining global state for critical configurations like cache expiration policies and API request limits. It includes asynchronous background threads to refresh the cache periodically, minimizing the impact on active client requests. The function integrates with an external logging service to capture detailed metrics and error reports, enabling monitoring and auditing for performance and reliability.

