The function efficiently manages memory allocation and deallocation by using a dynamic array of `LTEPHY_RRC_CONNECTION_CONFIG` structures to store the configuration information for each UE. The function also handles potential edge cases where traffic volume or UE count exceeds system limits by reducing the number of UEs to the maximum allowed value and reducing the mac_rx_window size of any UE that exceeds the maximum allowed value.

